            "speaker_cons": "C.kakashi.WMAIN",
            "speaker_before_intro": "银发青年",
            "text": "（日语）那个，我觉得现在是不是还处于录音模式？",
            "lang": "ja",
            "stage": "银发的那个声音插进来，轻，带着一点不确定——像是认真在听现场，又像是故意泼冷水。",
            "provenance": {
              "source_kind": "canon_quote",
              "event_uid": "E008-01",
              "canon_src": "source/novel_1-69.md:L2608",
              "speaker_cons": "C.kakashi.WMAIN",
              "adaptation_kind": "direct_quote",
              "surface_zh": "那个，我觉得现在是不是还处于录音模式？"
            }
          },
          {
            "role": "npc",
            "speaker_cons": "C.maki.WMAIN",
            "speaker_before_intro": "短发的年轻女人",
            "text": "（日语）你们三个真是够了，还要发展成舞台剧才甘心么！",
            "lang": "ja",
            "stage": "她踮着脚从人群缝隙里望向旗杆，语气里全是被挡住镜头的恼火。",
            "provenance": {
              "source_kind": "canon_quote",
              "event_uid": "E008-01",
              "canon_src": "source/novel_1-69.md:L2610",
              "speaker_cons": "C.maki.WMAIN",
              "adaptation_kind": "direct_quote"
            }
          },
          {
            "role": "npc",
            "speaker_cons": "C.maki.WMAIN",
            "speaker_before_intro": "短发的年轻女人",
            "text": "（日语）为什么都要长得这么高？长得高会有奖励不成？为什么要这么挡住我的视线！",
            "lang": "ja",
            "stage": "",
            "provenance": {
              "source_kind": "canon_quote",
              "event_uid": "E008-01",
              "canon_src": "source/novel_1-69.md:L2619",
              "speaker_cons": "C.maki.WMAIN",
              "adaptation_kind": "direct_quote"
            }
          },
          {
            "role": "npc",
            "speaker_cons": "C.xiuzai.WMAIN",
            "speaker_before_intro": "懒洋洋的年轻男人",
            "text": "（日语）老姐，你让晴明背你就好了。",
            "lang": "ja",
            "stage": "他随口一扔，像是给银发那位找了个差事。",
            "provenance": {
              "source_kind": "canon_quote",
              "event_uid": "E008-01",
              "canon_src": "source/novel_1-69.md:L2621",
              "speaker_cons": "C.xiuzai.WMAIN",
              "adaptation_kind": "direct_quote"
            }
          },
          {
            "role": "npc",
            "speaker_cons": "C.kakashi.WMAIN",
            "speaker_before_intro": "银发青年",
            "text": "（日语）嘛，我不在意哟，表姐看起来也不很重呢，这样的身高的话……",
            "lang": "ja",
            "stage": "银发青年偏过头接了一句，像是认真，又像是故意添乱。",
            "provenance": {
              "source_kind": "canon_quote",
              "event_uid": "E008-01",
              "canon_src": "source/novel_1-69.md:L2623",
              "speaker_cons": "C.kakashi.WMAIN",
              "adaptation_kind": "direct_quote",
              "surface_zh": "嘛，我不在意哟，表姐看起来也不很重呢，这样的身高的话……"
            }
          },
          {
            "role": "npc",
            "speaker_cons": "C.maki.WMAIN",
            "speaker_before_intro": "短发的年轻女人",
            "text": "（日语）请不要变相取笑我的身高问题好么？",
            "lang": "ja",
            "stage": "",
            "provenance": {
              "source_kind": "canon_quote",
              "event_uid": "E008-01",
              "canon_src": "source/novel_1-69.md:L2625",
              "speaker_cons": "C.maki.WMAIN",
              "adaptation_kind": "direct_quote"
            }
          },
          {
            "role": "narrate",
            "speaker": "旁白",
            "text": "那位短发的年轻女人不甘心地绕开人群，追着升旗手离开的方向去了。剩下三人还围着那台单反嘀咕。",
            "stage": "她的身影很快没进散场的人群。",
            "provenance": {
              "source_kind": "canon_adaptation",
              "event_uid": "E008-01",
              "canon_src": "source/novel_1-69.md:L2627-L2635",
              "adaptation_kind": "compressed_transition"
            }
          },
          {
            "role": "narrate",
            "speaker": "旁白",
            "text": "人群散得更开。那个圆脸青年退了半步，手里单反的带子甩过来，差点蹭到你胳膊——他下意识一缩手。",
            "stage": "",
            "provenance": {
              "source_kind": "authored_addition",
              "event_uid": "E008-01",
              "adaptation_kind": "physical_contact_beat"
            }
          },
          {
            "role": "npc",
            "speaker_cons": "C.akito.WMAIN",
            "speaker_before_intro": "圆脸青年",
            "text": "（日语）对不起！",
            "lang": "ja",
            "stage": "他下意识蹦出一句外语道歉，随即愣了一下，像是才意识到身边还有别人。",
            "provenance": {
